# m69S.ideal (= m69R with the close of column 0 merged: E0 pushes P0 + BL up in one spit; no P0 close pulse): open: lever (R0/R1 at t1); R2, s1 (TM up), U1 (BM down) at 2; P0 push [p0, p0+4) (column 0 up, BL back);
